The '''Forge Basin''' is an area in {{Zone|The Forge}}, in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}. Here you can speak to {{NPCSprite|Jotraeline Greatforge}}, who can upgrade and give perks to [[Drills]]. 

It is one of the locations where the {{MobSprite|Powder Ghast}} can spawn. Also, the {{Item|Dark Monolith}} will sometimes spawn on top of the pot, next to {{NPCSprite|Jotraeline Greatforge}}.

